I next look at clothes for exercise.
I have gym on Tuesday and Thursday evenings at half past five.
I need a new t-shirt to wear in the gym.
There is a large red t-shirt there.
I pick it up and look.
This is a good t-shirt.
A shop assistant comes near me.
"What is the price of this?" I ask her.
"This is three hundred rupees," she says.
Three hundred rupees is not a big price.
I go to the dressing room again.
I put on that red t-shirt.
This large t-shirt is very good.
It is a light garment.
It is very comfortable to wear.
This is very good for the gym.
I decide to buy this.
